=== note on the delete attempt above ===
The `ch-remote --api-socket ... delete` calls were a diagnostic cleanup shortcut,
not the product delete path. They returned no error but left the VMMs alive, so
the remaining processes were terminated with SIGKILL. The agent's own
`delete_vm` does not use this path: it calls `shutdown_removed_vmm_or_kill` and
verifies death (crates/chv-agent-runtime-ch/src/process.rs, delete_vm). This
observation is therefore not evidence of a product delete defect.
